  "body": "**What.** From #13's last states, `I13-win/chain_d6/anm_pin3_D192.0000.npz` and `I13-win/chain_d10/anm_pin3_D191.5000.npz`, run one corrector step with `--corrector od --tol_od 1e-40`, and compare its \u0394 and state with the qd result. Recommended by win in #13's summary.\n\n**Why.** The quad-double corrector's last steps end at 6.4e-29 to 7.5e-29 against its 1e-28 tolerance, so #215 will likely switch to the octo-double corrector soon. The od path has not yet run on these chains' D.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** od reaches |F| < 1e-40 on both states, and |\u0394_od \u2212 \u0394_qd| < 1e-18 at each. `octo_corrector.py planted` and `wall` pass, with their controls (`--mutate_offset qd`, `--mutate 10`) failing.\n\n**Depends on.** #13, #215.\n",
